{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前、\nbowlineに奈々未を誘って行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなかたの歌を生で聴けて嬉しかっな～～\n富士急からのだったので自分のタフさに驚いた～～、対バン系って目当てじゃないかたにもハマっちゃうよね～～なんか色々ハマった～～(余韻)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松井玲奈さんとも合流し、\n久しぶりに会えて嬉しかった！とても気さく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのあとは、\n安定の奈々未と二人ご飯(定期開催)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後「お腹すいた～～」\n奈々未「お腹すいたね～～」\n川後「肉～～」\n奈々未「ご飯行きたいね～～」\n川後「いついく～～？いつでもいける～～」\n奈々未「今日でも全然いける～～」\n川後「え～～全然いける～～いこ～～」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばこの前、\n一実ともごはんした。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奈々未もよびたかったが予定あわず。\n久しぶりにずーと２人。\n気が合うから、話しやすい。\nのでマシンガントーク。盛り上がった。\n昔から仲良い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スイカメンバー(優里.かりん.純奈)\nでもあつまった。\n仕事で七瀬不在"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりがピンバッチ落としたっていうから\nみんなで雨の中歩き回って\n探したのが面白かった、笑\n結局、純奈が道に落ちてるのを発見！！\n見つかったのがすごい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんといろんなメンバーと\n最近はいるな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♥♥みんなと仲良し、\nだけどびっくりするくらい写真とらない。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/11/11/9087670/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなのfavorite琴子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち"}],"source":"archive"}